CATEGORY_COVERAGE_CHECKLIST_15=
  1. Context propagation (context.Background() outside main/init/tests)
  2. Resource leaks (rows.Close, body.Close, tx.Rollback, ticker.Stop, file Close)
  3. Error handling drift (http.Error instead of writeError, swallowed errors `_ =`, missing %w wrap)
  4. SQL safety (fmt.Sprintf into queries, missing time-bound on signal_log, missing LIMIT)
  5. Concurrency (goroutine leaks, mutex-after-defer, sync.Map abuse, panic risk in goroutines without recover())
  6. Layering (snapshot-table reads for live state, sync Redis on ingest, bypassing SignalStore L1)
  7. Input validation (chi.URLParam -> strconv without bounds checks)
  8. Response shape (non-snake_case JSON tags, inconsistent error envelopes, unit-mislabel e.g. distance_mi populated into distance_km)
  9. Error wrap context (return err without fmt.Errorf("op %d: %w", id, err))
 10. Logging (fmt.Print*/log.Print* instead of zerolog)
 11. Pagination (list endpoints without limit/offset cap)
 12. Long handlers (single function >150 LOC that could be decomposed)
 13. Dead code (unused exported functions, unreachable branches, never-called methods)
 14. Hardcoded magic (magic numbers, URLs, thresholds)
 15. Timeouts (external HTTP/DB calls without context.WithTimeout)

